.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.log
__pycache__/
.worktrees/
target/
*.jsonl
# The local Runtime state directory a developer or a session creates in the repository root:
# the serve token, the sealed broker credential store, the keyring and the live event stores.
# It was NOT ignored, and a single "git add -A" in a session worktree staged
# .graphhelm/broker/credentials.json, .graphhelm/serve.key and both event-store tokens.
# Caught before any push (#1184), which is luck rather than a safeguard: untracked is not a
# guard, an ignore rule is.
/.graphhelm/
# The optional full check (ci/gate.ps1) writes its run manifests under .factory/gate-runs/. The
# receipt store and the runners that committed it were retired on 2026-09-24; a local run's
# manifest is scratch and never committed.
/.factory/
